---
description: API and worker conventions
globs:
  - "apps/api/**/*.ts"
  - "apps/worker/**/*.ts"
---

- Keep HTTP handlers thin.
- Domain logic belongs in services.
- External providers are adapters behind interfaces.
- Validate all external input with Zod.
- Database writes must be explicit and transactional where multiple related records change.
- Never log secrets or raw external content.
